<title>USA: Golf Training Systems names CEO.</title>
<headline>Golf Training Systems names CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DULUTH, Ga. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Golf Training Systems Inc said on Tuesday it had named Daniel Gordon chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Gordon, an outside director of the company since June, 1996, has been a principal with Corporate Growth Services.</p>
<p>Wayne McDonald, who previously held the title of CEO, will remain chairman of the board.</p>
